+## 2026-11-27 — The known failures may only shrink (S306p)
+
+**What happened.** The building seat sent the thin path's tenth patch. The tests that fail on main today, and the checks
+that are red, are to be listed in one file, each tied to the register row that holds it. The list may only get shorter: a
+new gate fails if it ever grows. A change that brings a failure the list does not hold will be refused when it lands. Its
+first seven entries are the tests that failed alone in main's own full run on a fresh clone.
+
+0 of 19.
